\" establishes that the princess had a rosegarden.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-003\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"She visited the rosegarden every morning from 8 am till 9 am\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"right after her breakfast\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A says the morning visit was right after her breakfast.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-005\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"From 02:00 till 15:30 o'clock, she worked in the rosegarden to tidy it up.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this verbatim.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-006\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Her mother did not appreciate that she, as a princess, would actually work in the garden\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-007\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"but the princess didn't care\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A says the princess didn't care about her mother's disapproval.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-008\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The rosegarden lost all his life in winter\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"The claim is the same statement with \\\"his\\\" rendered as \\\"its\\\".\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-009\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"But once spring arrived, it turned back to life and color.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this directly of the rosegarden.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-010\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the rose garden was the private property of the royal family\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-011\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the young princess insisted on making the garden accessible to the public every March 1st to March 31st\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-012\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"people from all over the country traveled to the castel to enjoy a nice day wandering through the rosegarden\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"The claim restates the source, with \\\"castel\\\" corrected to \\\"castle\\\".\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-013\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"It became tradition that everyone who visited the rosegarden from the outside picked their favorite scenery and tried to draw what they liked most.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this verbatim.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-014\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"They then sent the postcard to their home.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A says the visitors sent the postcard to their home.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-015\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"People were starting to make bets on whether the postcard arrived at their home before they arrived home.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this verbatim.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-016\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"In many cases, it was a tie\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A says that in many cases the bet was a tie.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-017\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the people and the postcards were usually transported in the same carriage\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_a.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source A states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-018\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"there was an old lady that lived in a dark, spooky forest\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this and adds the word \\\"spooky\\\".\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-019\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The forest was not traversable between October and April\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-020\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The forest was not traversable between October and April as it was too wet and too cold.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B says the forest was too wet and too cold in that period.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-021\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The old lady nevertheless lived the entire year in the forest.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-022\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Over the years, she acclimated to the weather\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-023\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"built strategies to survive the harsh conditions\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-024\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"many people suspected the old lady would be a witch that worked on forbidden magic\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-025\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"she collected wild herbs\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-026\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Instead of harvesting skulls and bones, she collected wild herbs.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"\\\"Instead of harvesting skulls and bones\\\" means she did not harvest them.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-027\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Those wild herbs were tried and sold to wandering travelers\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"The source's \\\"tried\\\" is evidently a typo for \\\"dried\\\" in this context, so it states that the herbs were dried.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-028\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"sold to wandering travelers\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-029\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"wandering travelers who transported and sold the herbs into the cities\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-030\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"In one harsh winter, many people of the nearby village became very sick.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"\\\"Nearby village\\\" refers to the village near the forest.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-031\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"In a desperate attempt to help the villagers, one young man took the courage and traveled to the old lady's house deep in the woods.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-032\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"the old lady's house deep in the woods\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-033\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"It took him days to reach her house\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-034\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"he struggled with the wet and slippery ground\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-035\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"He also lost his orientation several times.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-036\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"But eventually, he reached her house.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-037\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"He carefully knocked\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B says he carefully knocked at her house.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-038\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"hoped that all the rumors about the lady were untrue\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-039\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"she asked him to come into her house\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-040\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"sit at the fire\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"The same sentence of source B includes asking him to sit at the fire.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-041\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"drink some hot soup she made for him\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"The same sentence of source B includes asking him to drink the soup.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-042\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"When the man recovered again, she gave him enough medicine made out of the herbs she collected in spring for the entire village.\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-043\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"medicine made out of the herbs she collected in spring\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-044\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"He traveled back to his village\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-045\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"went to the home of every sick person to provide them with the correct amount of medicine as told by the old lady from the woods\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-046\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Eventually, everyone got healthy again\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this, in context of the villagers.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"M-047\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"from then on the villagers sent a huge basket of cheese and dried meat to the old lady every autumn\",\"evidence_source\":\"source_b.md\",\"rationale\":\"Source B states this directly.\"}]}","ttft_ms":6566,"type":"result","duration_ms":31891,"uuid":"d9797817-9237-418b-bd60-a91c4b525c35","ttft_stream_ms":1540,"time_to_request_ms":106,"first_content_frame_ms":1541,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
